Parts that come from others:

- Fotobuch (https://github.com/EddyXorb/fotobuch), GNU AGPL v3. The Windows app ships the
  unchanged fotobuch.exe of the version named in packaging/windows/get_fotobuch.ps1, with a note
  where its source code is (fotobuch/SOURCE-fotobuch.txt in the installed app).
  src/autobook/resources/autobook.typ is Fotobuch's page template with autobook's additions
  (tools/make_template.py); src/autobook/resources/fotobuch-upstream-v0.3.0.typ is the original.
- GeoNames city data (cities1000) through reverse_geocoder, Creative Commons Attribution 4.0,
  https://www.geonames.org/
- Newsreader and Inter fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (src/autobook/web/static/fonts/OFL-newsreader.txt, OFL-inter.txt).
- The Python libraries the app is built from keep their own licenses (see their package metadata
  in the installed app's _internal folder).
